'''''Oblation Obtained, Order Ordained''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Topclouded Towerthrust]].

==Steps==
# Go to Dragonvista Rain Hall
# (Optional) Talk to others in the hall
# Open the "road" to the Ambrosial Arbor with the power of the high elder

