===Go to Dragonvista Rain Hall{{subst:void|<!--102140102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Scalegorge Waterscape|update|When you stepped into Scalegorge Waterscape, you never thought that you would encounter such a chaotic situation. The old nemesis who sought vengeance blocked your way, and the young swordsman pursuing him was determined to not let either of you leave. It wasn't until General Jing Yuan appeared that you realized your past on the Xianzhou was finally catching up to you.<br />Someone had led you, the reincarnation of the Vidyadhara high elder, to this place. Someone is asking you to reproduce the miracles of the past &mdash; except no one ever asked you whether you consent to all this.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Look, your friends are taking the fight to the Legion as we speak...
:'''Dan Heng:''' We need to help them, let's go.
;(Enter battle)
::Wave 1: {{Список врагов|mode=sent|Antibaryon*3/-20% ATK; Voidranger: Distorter*1/-20% ATK}}
::Wave 2: {{Список врагов|mode=sent|Voidranger: Reaver*2/-20% ATK; Voidranger: Distorter*2/-20% ATK}}
::Wave 3: {{Список врагов|mode=sent|Voidranger: Reaver*2/-20% ATK; Voidranger: Trampler*1/-20% ATK; Baryon*1/-20% ATK}}
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Jing Yuan! Where have you been!?
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Haha, forgive my late arrival, Lady Fu &mdash; we are indebted to you and your forces. The Seat of Divine Foresight relayed the battle reports to me. As for Phantylia's plan...
:'''Fu Xuan:''' The Ambrosial Arbor &mdash; that's her focus.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Lord Ravager Phantylia's strategy was to create civil strife &mdash; then let it consume the Xianzhou from within. She wanted to use the Arbor to disseminate the power of the Plagues Author... and turn the Luofu into a hell of undying abominations.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Mm, that is clear to me now. Friends of the Astral Express, I have brought someone with me whom I think you'll be eager to see.
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? I&mdash;Is that... Dan Heng!? You...
:'''March 7th:''' Y&mdash;You are Dan Heng, right? What's with the horns...?
:'''Dan Heng:''' It's a long story, March. It's me.
:'''March 7th:''' So... you do have secret strength!?
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Let us save such reminiscence for later, shall we?
:'''Jing Yuan:''' My astral guests, when you first appeared on the Luofu, your stated aim was the resolution of the Stellaron crisis. I was concerned that the Stellaron Hunters harbored ulterior motives and refused your offer. I see now that I was overly anxious.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Nevertheless, it is true that the motives of the Stellaron Hunters were not what they appeared, haha. In order that the Express and the Xianzhou fight side by side, Kafka lured you here and broadened the scope of the crisis... In doing so, she succeeded in making clear that your sincerity is beyond doubt. The Luofu is in your debt, and I have no right to seek further assistance from you.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' However, as Lady Fu has explained, the appearance of Phantylia means that the situation is far from under our control. As general of the Luofu, it would be foolish of me not to ask Dan Heng and the rest of you for your strength at this critical moment.
:'''Welt:''' Even if the crisis on the Luofu had nothing to do with the Stellaron, I would be willing to help... but I can't speak for the other members of my crew.
:'''Welt:''' Explore, understand, establish, and connect... As the crew of the Express, that's the trailblaze creed we follow. Still, when the journey gets tough, those words can feel far-off.
:'''Welt:''' Fear, risk, enemies, and death are the obstacles we face in pursuit of the creed. That's why the Nameless who are able to stay the course number few indeed.
:'''Welt:''' Whether our destination lies before us or behind us, the decision is ours to make. Here, as on the Express, every vote counts.
:'''March 7th:''' Dan Heng...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Hold out hand)
::'''Jing Yuan:''' Thank you, Dan Heng.
::(Remain still)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Remain still)
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Jing Yuan:''' The choice is yours, Dan Heng.
:'''Dan Heng:''' How am I still one of the Nameless? I stand here at the mercy of others without true freedom to speak...
:{{tx}}

;(Talk to Female Protagonist)
:(Trailblazer) looks at you, as you both become silent.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there nothing you'd like to ask?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
:(Trailblazer) shakes {{MC|м=his|ж=her}} head. {{MC|м=He|ж=She}} doesn't want to speak. Nobody can get {{MC|м=him|ж=her}} to open up.

;(Talk to (Trailblazer))
:(Trailblazer) looks at you, as you both become silent.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there nothing you'd like to ask?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
::(Trailblazer) shakes {{MC|м=his|ж=her}} head. {{MC|м=He|ж=She}} doesn't want to speak. Nobody can get {{MC|м=him|ж=her}} to open up.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' ...

;(Talk to Fu Xuan)
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Imbibitor Lunae's reincarnation... Dan Heng, correct? I have heard your name before.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How can that be, my name was erased...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why would the names of the banished be recorded?
::'''Fu Xuan:''' Your name was only erased from the public eye. But as the master diviner, I know &mdash; and should know &mdash; all the records of years gone by... Such archives are of great importance in times of need.
::'''Fu Xuan:''' I was not born in the heroic and extraordinary era of the High-Cloud Quintet. To have seen those legends with my own eyes...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Go on...
::'''Fu Xuan:''' Your appearance closely matches the depiction in the annals... Does Vidyadhara reincarnation really entail a complete transformation &mdash; a new life?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Perhaps it is a little inappropriate of me to pry into the secrets of the Vidyadhara...
::'''Fu Xuan:''' ...but your appearance closely matches the depiction in the annals... Does Vidyadhara reincarnation really entail a complete transformation &mdash; a new life?

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' I knew you'd come. When we first mentioned the Xianzhou, there was a sad look in your eyes.
::'''Welt:''' They may have banished you, but the Luofu is still your home.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thanks for all your help along the way...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm sorry I never spoke up...
::'''Welt:''' You're a member of the Express Crew, Dan Heng. Let's settle this matter as soon as possible &mdash; our journey doesn't end here.
:'''Welt:''' *sigh* Those two haven't exactly been on their best behavior... It would've been good to have you here earlier.

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' You scared the heck outta me! For a second I thought you'd annoyed the general &mdash; it seemed like you were his prisoner. There I was thinking up a plan to kidnap you, and it turns out the two of you are old buddies!
::'''March 7th:''' Soooo what made you suddenly decide to come down from the Express?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I was worried for your safety.
:::'''March 7th:''' Aww, how sweet! Buuuut (Trailblazer), Mr. Yang, and I have been holding our own &mdash; we're pretty much Xianzhou heroes at this point.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
:::'''March 7th:''' Okay, okay, I won't push you &mdash; everyone has their secrets. Besides, given the circumstances, my curiosity can wait.
::'''March 7th:''' Anyway, it's great to have you with us, Dan Heng!
:'''March 7th:''' Y'know, the more I look at this statue, the less "Dan-Hengy" it gets...
::'''March 7th:''' Still, it's got the same stony expression, haha.

;(Talk to Jing Yuan)
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Has coming here triggered your memory?
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Release your full potential &mdash; the power you carry is the key to opening a way through to the Ambrosial Arbor.

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
----
----
:The statue of the High Elder has been greatly changed by years of weathering. There are small words engraved near its base.
:"Hearken, as arbor revives and foe nears, we call forth the mighty waters of ancient sea, to flood abodes of heaven and quell roots of evil. We etch this in stone for all to heed."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Try to feel the great power here...
::Beneath the endless rolling waves, the ancient roots of the arbor blaze. Long dormant, they stir and come to life, as if a beast were waking from its strife.
::The containment mechanisms woven by past thrones, the bindings that tamed the beasts' power known, a fragile net, soon to shatter and fall, its decay a warning, heard by one and all.
::Memories from the past emerge from the darkness, tightly gripping you...
